      "title": "#4 骑士之礼"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "705001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这里是什么地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "总觉得有一种神奇的熟悉感……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "等等，优纪，别……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这个地方……我是不是曾经来过……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "感觉好熟悉好亲切……可是又那么的……悲伤……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，你知不知道这是为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，冷静下来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，那个东西，我好像见过的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "它的主人会是谁呢……我会不会和那个家伙认识呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是，我从被主人买回家开始就一直生活在主人的家里，对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "难道不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "主人曾经提起过，你是被他捡回家的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "捡回家的……吗？那么，我原本是不是就生活在这里呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这不可能，你怎么可能会在这里生活过，你没有在这里生活的记忆，不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你说的没错……我完全没有在这里生活的记忆……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是这种莫名其妙的熟悉感越来越强烈，又是为什么呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江酱，你那么聪明，能告诉我这是为什么……吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "705020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……我不知道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
